{"id":"n67865-1-6","stage":0,"title":"요일 · 星期","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67865-1-6-1","ko":"넌 여기에 무슨 요일에 오니?","zh":"你一般哪天会来这儿？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요일에","meaning":"星期，周，礼拜","explanation":"요일：星期，周，礼拜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"요일","audio":"/audio/6113ec29a141e7f24d8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67865","senseId":"1","lemma":"요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오니?","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"6113ec29a141e7f2","term":"요일","zh":"星期，周，礼拜","audio":"/audio/6113ec29a141e7f24d8f.mp3","entryId":"67865","definition":"组成一个星期的每一天。","pronunciation":["요일"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3637f10271ac8cc501e3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67865-1-6-2","ko":"난 화요일과 목요일에 와.","zh":"我是在周二和周四来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화요일과","meaning":"星期二，周二，礼拜二","explanation":"화요일：星期二，周二，礼拜二；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"화요일","audio":"/audio/94e234f76b8eab7e261f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73231","senseId":"1","lemma":"화요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목요일에","meaning":"星期四，周四，礼拜四","explanation":"목요일：星期四，周四，礼拜四；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"목요일","audio":"/audio/42d1a6367432ff8ec3d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55874","senseId":"1","lemma":"목요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"94e234f76b8eab7e","term":"화요일","zh":"星期二，周二，礼拜二","audio":"/audio/94e234f76b8eab7e261f.mp3","entryId":"73231","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第二天。","pronunciation":["화요일"]},{"id":"42d1a6367432ff8e","term":"목요일","zh":"星期四，周四，礼拜四","audio":"/audio/42d1a6367432ff8ec3d4.mp3","entryId":"55874","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第四天。","pronunciation":["모교일"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/22826706d259a5ad885c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67865","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":26,"sequenceScore":1.0867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你一般哪天会来这儿？","我是在周二和周四来的。","敏俊最近学习可真用功啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你一般哪天会来这儿？","我是在周二和周四来的。","敏俊最近学习可真用功啊。"],"answer":1}]}
